 :question/worked-solution "Using the triangle inequality, we have that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}‖5u-4v‖ & \\le ‖5u‖+‖-4v‖.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSimplifying and substituting in the given information, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}‖5u-4v‖ & \\le 5‖u‖+4‖v‖ \\\\ 26 & \\le 5\\cdot 2+4‖v‖ \\\\ 26 & \\le 10+4‖v‖ \\\\ 16 & \\le 4‖v‖ \\\\ 4 & \\le ‖v‖.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the smallest possible value of $‖v‖$ is $4.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-140459/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "0ae3aec8-4d20-5467-9ced-2a9c1bda3afd"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-140459"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "q-40244"] :question/problem "Given that $‖7u+v‖=32$ and $‖v‖=4$, find the smallest possible value of $‖u‖.$" :question/worked-solution "Using the triangle inequality, we have that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}‖7u+v‖ & \\le ‖7u‖+‖v‖.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSimplifying and substituting in the given information, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}‖7u+v‖ & \\le 7‖u‖+‖v‖ \\\\ 32 & \\le 7‖u‖+4 \\\\ 28 & \\le 7‖u‖ \\\\ 4 & \\le ‖u‖.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the smallest possible value of $‖u‖$ is $4.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "q-40899/selection/7845f5bf94d2cfe99f73682a34529955af46f8f5d6f59bb198a07cbc245060af" :answer/id #uuid "5d7ceaf9-cb2c-5167-b93a-73afdfe51055" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "8" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-40899/selection/266f8fc061957f6a8756e2983e0b79d344c2a4f70b57783044e99932e211632d" :answer/id #uuid "7e10044e-ed22-54b7-a9ae-c4df3896e1e4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{27}{5}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-40899/selection/c53fda742d514dd498dc2a3065d035257b7cfc54103a9f93cd46b054f212d1b5" :answer/id #uuid "4571f5ae-bc56-58ec-9ede-7eb63e137bc0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{27}{4}" :db/